# build/container/Dockerfile build context trim. Keep this conservative:
# only exclude directories the boid binary's `go build .` (and its go:embed
# directives under web/, internal/skills, internal/db/migrate,
# internal/initwizard) never touch. See build/container/Dockerfile's header
# comment for what the image build actually needs.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.codex/
docs/
e2e/
*.md
LICENSE

# The metaproject library's own unit tests. They are part of the boid repo (CI
# runs them) but have no business inside a job's skills directory: an agent
# browsing ~/.claude/skills/boid-metaproject/ should see the scripts it can run
# and the docs it should read, not a test suite it will mistake for either.
# go:embed already skips them for the same reason (a leading "_" is excluded
# unless the pattern says all:) — this keeps COPY's copy of the tree in step.
internal/skills/data/boid-metaproject/scripts/_tests/
